-- =====================================================================
--  ServiceLink - Demonstration Seed Data
--  Fictional client: i604 Systems Inc. (Vancouver, BC)
--  Data period: January 2026 - August 2026
--
--  Group A - INFO 2413 S50 - System Development Project - Summer 2026
--
--
--  Recent tickets are dated relative to NOW(), so the dashboard KPI
--  tiles, the seven-day volume chart and the SLA countdowns are always
--  current no matter which day the database is loaded.
--
--  Sign-in accounts
--    admin@i604.org          Admin@i604!     Administrator
